 "transcript": [
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung sees his sons at the western gate.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We have returned, father, and we are ready to begin.\"",
  "[says] Wang Lung expresses his age and forgetfulness.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now I am old and forgetful and I do not know what I am talking about. I do not even know if I have any sons.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung sees his sons again.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and now it is too late to go back on anything. It is all done.\"",
  "[action] Second son and eldest son leave.",
